#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:8
msgid "lxd-support interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"`lxd-support` enables operating as the LXD service. This interface can "
"currently only be established with the upstream LXD project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:12
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:14
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br> **Transitional**: yes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:14
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:19
msgid ""
"The `lxd-support` plug is {ref}`unsupported for parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-unsupported>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:22
msgid "**Attributes**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-support-interface.md:24
msgid ""
"**enable-unconfined-mode** (plug, optional):  indicates that snapd should "
"make use of the AppArmor `unconfined` profile mode (if this is supported by "
"the system) when generating the associated AppArmor profiles for the snap "
"which plugs this interface."
msgstr ""
